**Summary:** The strip-down is exactly the intended 9 config edits and restores native/quant side behavior relative to the July 20 +869 config. Main residual risk is not a code-safety issue but whether ETH/native and UP-tape shorts remain around coinflip after the blunt gates stop suppressing them.
